      "speaker": "human:facilitator",
      "prompt": "I sketched our IoT pipeline by hand: the strokes and labels on the board. Turn it into a clean diagram: a proper shape for each labeled box, real connectors that follow my arrows in the same direction, then remove my rough strokes and the loose labels you've replaced. Keep roughly the same layout.",
